<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 27-FEB.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 27-FEB.</headline>
<text>
<p>A disturbance tracking by the North West Cape of Australia is likely causing rough seas and wind. This continues a minor risk to shipping with top winds near 30 mph. However, further strengthening is possible this period at which time the threat to shipping would increase.</p>
<p>There are no emergency statements at this time.</p>
<p>There are no emergence statements at this time.</p>
</text>
